sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Dev as Developer or Alan agent
    participant CLI as TestProof CLI
    participant Diff as Diff resolver
    participant Eng as Mutation engine
    participant SB as Sandbox
    participant Test as Project test command
    participant Ver as Kill verifier
    participant Model as Open source model
    participant Rep as Report

    Dev->>CLI: testproof grade --base origin/main
    CLI->>Diff: resolve changed files and lines
    Diff-->>CLI: files and line ranges
    CLI->>Eng: grade the diff
    loop each mutant on changed lines
        Eng->>SB: apply the mutant to a copy
        Eng->>Test: run the project test command
        Test-->>Eng: pass, fail, or timeout
        Eng->>SB: restore the copy
    end
    Eng->>Rep: score and survivor list
    Rep-->>CLI: report.json
    CLI-->>Dev: score and survivors

    opt score below the threshold
        loop each survivor
            CLI->>Model: code, mutant, and existing tests
            Model-->>CLI: candidate test
            CLI->>Ver: verify the candidate
            Ver->>Test: run on the original code
            Test-->>Ver: must pass
            Ver->>SB: apply the same mutant
            Ver->>Test: run on the mutant
            Test-->>Ver: must fail
            Ver->>SB: restore the copy
            Ver-->>CLI: keep or reject with a reason
        end
        CLI->>Eng: re grade with the kept tests
        Eng-->>Rep: new score
        Rep-->>Dev: before and after evidence
    end
